description = "A lithe, shadowy predator that phases in and out of visibility in sync with the Twilight Grove's erratic light cycle. Hunts in silence, telegraphing its attack only by a brief luminescent pulse. Highly prized by alchemists — its venom is the base for the most potent paralytic compounds."
